"><span style=\"color: #04504f;\">More insight. Clearer analysis. The same authoritative rankings.</span></span></h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n\t\t\t<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"hs_padded\" style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#23496d; word-break:break-word; padding:10px 30px 0px\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module\" id=\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_175746123942239\" style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_rich_text\" id=\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_175746123942239_\" style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:150%; text-align:left\"><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #fbfbfa;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #fbfbfa;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fbfbfa;\">Infrastructure finance in H1 2026 remained resilient and increasingly concentrated, propelled by an unprecedented wave of AI-driven capital expenditure. Hyperscalers' pledges of hundreds of billions of dollars toward data centre buildouts translated directly into deal activity, even as the prospect of rising global interest rates weighed on the broader financial markets.</span></span></span></p>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:150%; text-align:left\"> </p>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:150%; text-align:left\"><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #fbfbfa;\">This cycle's Infrastructure and Project Finance League Table Report has had an upgrade, providing more insight-led analysis and at-a-glance key takeaways, designed to go beyond the data to better serve your decision-making.</span></p>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:150%; text-al